shared/vfx/CameraShake.ts        → Trauma-based camera shake
shared/vfx/HitStop.ts            → Frame freeze on impacts
shared/vfx/MotionTrails.ts       → Trail rendering for fast objects
shared/vfx/ShockwaveRings.ts     → Emissive expanding rings
shared/vfx/FloatingText.ts       → Dynamic score text system
```

### 5.3 Shared Utils Layer (`shared/utils/`)
```
shared/utils/ProceduralTextures.ts → Canvas API texture generation
shared/utils/Noise.ts            → Simplex noise implementation
shared/utils/MathUtils.ts        → Vector/quaternion helpers
